  "body": "## Summary\n- Add a dated Atlas chunk-boundary policy v2 record with a structural-first table for Markdown/docs, code, logs, chat/session stores, and fixed-window fallback.\n- Record size/overlap rationales and a staged migration policy for existing chunks.\n- Add the design record to the architecture index.\n\nThe proposal uses 0–5% overlap for structural splitters and 10% for fixed-window fallback. It cites the landed #6039 overlap experiment and #6038 boundary-drift report, and explicitly leaves span identity/reuse/mapping provisional pending open parent #6028. No chunker or live-data migration is implemented.\n\n## Verification\n- Doc-only acceptance script: all five source rows have size and overlap rationales; structural overlap is lower than fixed-window overlap; #6028 provisional note present; index link resolves.\n- `git diff --check`\n\nThe #6039 experiment used fixed 200-word windows, BM25, and a provisional golden set; dense retrieval and the #6027 golden-set rerun remain outstanding.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796780189&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7902&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7902&signature=205c34ae60f71e843c2a73814166797c84c7fa7ac7ac2e45dd0a40f9695336d2\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7902?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
